{"text":"The friends with whom I sat on graduation day have been my friends for life. They are my children's godparents, the people to whom I've been able to turn in times of real trouble. People who have been kind enough not to sue me when I took their names for Death Eaters. At our graduation, we were bound by enormous affection, by our shared experience of a time that could never come again, and of course, by the knowledge that we held certain photographic evidence that would be exceptionally valuable if any of us ran for Prime Minister. So today, I wish you nothing better than similar friendships. And tomorrow, I hope that even if you remember not a single word of mine, you remember those of Seneca, another of those old Romans I met when I fled down the Classics Corridor in retreat from career ladders in search of ancient wisdom.","words":[{"text":"The","start":0.0,"end":0.68},{"text":"friends","start":0.68,"end":1.04},{"text":"with","start":1.04,"end":1.22},{"text":"whom","start":1.22,"end":1.46},{"text":"I","start":1.46,"end":1.66},{"text":"sat","start":1.66,"end":1.92},{"text":"on","start":1.92,"end":2.16},{"text":"graduation","start":2.16,"end":2.58},{"text":"day","start":2.58,"end":3.04},{"text":"have","start":3.04,"end":3.24},{"text":"been","start":3.24,"end":3.46},{"text":"my","start":3.46,"end":3.68},{"text":"friends","start":3.68,"end":3.9},{"text":"for","start":3.9,"end":4.14},{"text":"life","start":4.14,"end":4.38,"punct":"."},{"text":"They","start":5.32,"end":5.5},{"text":"are","start":5.5,"end":5.62},{"text":"my","start":5.62,"end":5.8},{"text":"children's","start":5.8,"end":6.34},{"text":"godparents","start":6.34,"end":6.84,"punct":","},{"text":"the","start":7.52,"end":7.68},{"text":"people","start":7.68,"end":7.94},{"text":"to","start":7.94,"end":8.12},{"text":"whom","start":8.12,"end":8.34},{"text":"I've","start":8.34,"end":8.58},{"text":"been","start":8.58,"end":8.68},{"text":"able","start":8.68,"end":8.88},{"text":"to","start":8.88,"end":9.06},